          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The animated introduction is also deisgned to show the audience that this story takes place in a secondary world. It also acts as foresahdowing, because each scene of the animation is based on something that happens within the text. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
