    {
      "start_time": 262,
      "end_time": 289,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Jude's determination to avoid the classes where she is reminded of her place hint towards her aspirations to more. She intends to become a knight, because that is the only way humans are able to gain power in Faerie, and it is the only path to power she will accept."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
