    },
    {
      "start_time": 467,
      "end_time": 480,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The conversation between Jude and Taryn further defines the society they live in. Cardan's royal status provides him a certain level of immunity for any retaliations he makes. Jude doesn't have the same protections because she's a mortal. She has no real power, and no real control."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
