        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Attraction"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "80b002f7-f388-48ab-b251-fd0ad6ce6682"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 631,
      "end_time": 657,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cardan is isolating Jude here, further enforcing the barrier between them, by ensuring her sister can no longer help her. However, in Cardan's eyes, he is doing Jude a favour. He is protecting her sister from the wrath of his friends, ensuring their ire will only be directed towards Jude. This is a moment, later, that will remind Jude of the fact that Cardan did what he could to protect her family, even when he couldn't help her directly."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
