      "uuid": "45af8142-b97a-4da1-bb07-d388fad29226"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 694,
      "end_time": 722,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cardan is attempting to warn Jude, to remind her that she is mortal, that she cannot face them and win. Jude is determined to find a way anyway. She will prove him wrong, one way or another. She will continue to draw Cardan's attention, and his ire. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
