    },
    {
      "start_time": 841,
      "end_time": 886,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "They are very evenly matched in terms of sworplay, and part of Jude's determination in this scene is to take Cardan down. If she can prove herself against a Prince of Faerie, she will have respect and renown that she could not earn otherwise. Her intention to humiliate Cardan further implements the barrier between Cardan and Jude. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
