          "tag": "Attraction"
        },
        {
          "category": "Tropes",
          "tag": "Enemies to Lovers"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "2424ef72-70c7-48c0-8014-6d52d3258016"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 990,
      "end_time": 1002,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cardan seeks his revenge, reminding Jude that the little power she's won can be taken away as easily as her life. Cardan's constant threats towards Jude also create the barrier between them, but they also add to Jude's attraction to Cardan. She can't resist proving him wrong. She is determined to best him. She plans everything so that he will be the one under her control, which will eventually lead towards the moment of ritual death at the end of the first season. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "Genres",
          "tag": "Romantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Forms",
          "tag": "Movie"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Attraction"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Ritual Death"
        },
        {
          "category": "Tropes",
          "tag": "Enemies to Lovers"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "053bab33-d555-4de1-849b-2f8c56cd60ad"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1003,
      "end_time": 1015,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Everyone knows who Cardan is, and what he's capable of. Jude is the unknown, and that's what makes her interesting. Locke suggesting that they are about to find out what Jude is, foreshadows what she is about to become. Her determination to become untouchable and powerful intensifies the barrier between her and Cardan, because she's unwilling to trust him, or let him in, even knowing he can't lie to her. "
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "Genres",
          "tag": "Romantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Forms",
          "tag": "Movie"
        },
        {
          "category": "Fantasy",
          "tag": "Portal Fantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Society"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Barrier"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Attraction"
        },
        {
          "category": "Tropes",
          "tag": "Enemies to Lovers"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "27c0575e-dd14-4306-b585-3c47fd353bc9"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1016,
      "end_time": 1024,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cardan knows Jude can lie, which means he knows that if she did grovel at his feet, it would be a performance at best. All he can have from her is a performance, but he wants her to mean the things she says to him."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
