          "tag": "Attraction"
        },
        {
          "category": "Tropes",
          "tag": "Enemies to Lovers"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "d21ad666-d718-4456-a5ef-291fe88d9e40"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1025,
      "end_time": 1034,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Taryn is jealous of the attention Locke is paying Jude. Taryn aspires to gain power through a political match, whereas Jude wants to attain power in her own right. Taryn's jealousy leads to a moment of ritual death in the second season, when she dresses like Jude in order to manipulate Cardan."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "Genres",
          "tag": "Romantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Forms",
          "tag": "Movie"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Worldbuilding"
        },
        {
          "category": "Romantasy",
          "tag": "Ritual Death"
        },
        {
          "category": "Tropes",
          "tag": "Enemies to Lovers"
        }
      ],
      "uuid": "f4aa76f0-e822-43fa-89b8-c23a20fd99ea"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 1035,
      "end_time": 1085,
      "annotation": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cardan reinforces the barrier by reminding Jude of her place. She is worth less than he is, because he is a Prince of Faerie. The biggest barrier between them (aside from their animosity for each other) is the class difference. Jude is the adopted daughter of a general. Cardan is the Prince of Faerie. Cardan also has to contend with how he is perceived by his friends and family, and caring for a mortal girl would be deemed an embarassment. Unless, of course, that mortal girl could prove her cunning to the whole of Faerie."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        {
          "category": "Genres",
          "tag": "Romantasy"
        },
        {
          "category": "Forms",
